picious figures.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-07-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":13,"rating":8.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3h17GYvAm2GpiGMbYDFDi001yON.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3h17GYvAm2GpiGMbYDFDi001yON.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/293124/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"6359351","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Rua teams up with Sven, who suggests that the two of them infiltrate Viscount Dedmond's ball to find evidence of his wrongdoing. Meanwhile, Ariane is also planning to go to the ball with Garrote.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-07-31","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":13,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7kwNBVmRBobp6ASSlEwvi2LsquC.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7kwNBVmRBobp6ASSlEwvi2LsquC.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/293124/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"6359352","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Rua decides to infiltrate Viscount Dedmond's ball, but due to previous harassment, she doesn't have a suitable dress for a ball. Luckily, Prince Swen is now at her side.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-08-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":13,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sV5kQlS9eiHHkirHekeTu4N2lMn.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sV5kQlS9eiHHkirHekeTu4N2lMn.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/293124/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"6359353","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"At Dedmond's ball, Rua encounters Ariane again, who isn't provoked by her taunts. But when a servant appears at the ball with a knife, she makes another decision.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-08-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":15,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/izUYMW65CNZmqXLaSLBWNJ1a5mw.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/izUYMW65CNZmqXLaSLBWNJ1a5mw.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/293124/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"6464685","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"In order to obtain important documents from Viscount Dedmond, Rua entices him to meet alone in his chamber. Prince Swen strongly disagrees with this plan.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-08-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":13,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6FZSbtnCJ0QFZmzyuBO3BKdCu9n.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6FZSbtnCJ0QFZmzyuBO3BKdCu9n.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/293124/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"6470936","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Rua and Prince Swen manage to get hold of the documents in question when a ferocious monster suddenly appears. Is Ariane involved this time? What's her purpose?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-08-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":13,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8RB8eC7Xz1hKdKNGsX6skT93Wqg.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8RB8eC7Xz1hKdKNGsX6skT93Wqg.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/293124/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"6485822","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"When a beast suddenly rages at Dedmond's ball, Rua and Prince Swen confront it. Peace returns, and Rua awaits an audience with the king?!","la